Who made this game?
& kapman; was made by the KapTeam (see the Credits and License chapter). It is maintained by Thomas Gallinari and Pierre-Benoit Besse.
Where can I get cheatcodes?
You can look for cheatcodes inside the source code.
How do I start a new game?
A new game is already started when you launch & kapman;. Anyway, you can start a new game by clicking on the Game New menu item, or by the Ctrl; N key combination. See the Menubar section for more details.
I have started a new game. What do I do now?
You can start playing by pressing any arrow key. You must eat every pill and energizer of each level, while escaping the ghosts. See the How to Play chapter for more details.
How do I pause the game?
You can pause the game by pressing P or Esc. See the Default Keybindings section for more details.
Where are the high scores?
You can see the high scores table by clicking on the Game Show High Scores menu item. See the Menubar section for more details.
