Toggles on and off the display of the toolbar.
Settings Show Statusbar
Toggles on and off the display of the statusbar.
Settings Difficulty
Lets you set the difficulty level from a sub-menu.
There are four levels of difficulty:
Easy: 5 rows, 5 columns, without wrapping.
Medium: 7 rows, 7 columns, without wrapping.
Hard: 9 rows, 9 columns, without wrapping.
Very hard: 9 rows, 9 columns, with wrapping.
Settings Configure Shortcuts...
Opens a dialog which lets you redefine all the keyboard shortcuts.
Settings Configure Toolbars...
Displays a & kde; standard dialog where you can configure the toolbar icons.
Settings Configure Notifications...
This item displays a standard & kde; notifications configuration dialog, where you can change the notifications (sounds, visible messages, & etc;) used by & knetwalk;.
