& Ctrl; A
Select all
& Ctrl; C
Copy
& Ctrl; R
Rename file
& Ctrl; I
Guess tags from the Internet.
& Ctrl; G
Guess tags from the filename.
& Ctrl; F
New search playlist.
Guess tag entries based on filename
& Ctrl; N
New empty Playlist
& Ctrl; D
New playlist from folder.
& Ctrl; T
Save changes to edited tags.
