Installation
& kspread; is part of & kde; 's & koffice; package and uses various & koffice; libraries. & koffice; itself is part of & kde; and depends on the general & kde; libraries.
For instructions on acquiring and installing & kde;, & koffice; and & kspread; please visit http: / /www. kde. org and http: / /www. koffice. org.
