Contact Actions
Configure the Contact Actions
Binary
Contacts
Folder
Provides access to contacts, each stored in a single file, in a given folder. Supports standard VCard file and other formats depending on availability of plugins.
File
Provides access to contacts stored in a single local file. Supports standard VCard files and other formats depending on available plugins.
LDAP
Provides access to contacts stored on a LDAP directory server
Network
Provides access to contacts in remote files using KDE's network framework KIO. Supports standard VCard files and other formats depending on available plugins.
Calendar
Calendar in Local File
Provides access to a calendar stored in a single local file
Calendar in Local Directory
Provides access to calendar items, each stored in a single file, in a given directory
